      "entryId": "2026-10-04-daily-news-7",
      "headline": "Call of Duty: Modern Warfare 4: Modern Warfare 4 Details Server Culling Anti-Cheat System",
      "summary": "Activision and Infinity Ward detailed Server Culling, which withholds opponent-location data when players should not be able to see it, reducing information available to wallhacks. It is planned for every launch multiplayer map, Combat Outpost, Warzone, and future updates.",
